Repairs: "Expose approved command wait identity and elapsed lifecycle" the repository command runner retained a clock ending an otherwise running check, and POSIX identities were spelled as local numeric declarations.
Repairs: "Apply command policy duration through output EOF with shared wait diagnostics" the repository policy killed the command group when its stated duration elapsed instead of waiting for the operation's answer.
